  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To assist the PA in (a) minimising the threat posed to humans by HPAI infection and other zoonoses in domestic poultry; and (b) preparing for controlling and responding to avian influenza pandemic and other infectious disease emergencies among humans. This would be measured by: (i) sustained prevention rate among high-risk groupscomma (ii) reduced infection rate of HPAI in poultrycomma (iii) a targeted percentage of farmer&apos;s income loss compensated.</narrative>
  </description>
